  "extract": "Ernest Christy Cline is an American science fiction novelist, slam poet and screenwriter. He wrote the novels Ready Player One, Armada, and Ready Player Two, and co-wrote the screenplay for the film adaptation of Ready Player One, directed by Steven Spielberg.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Ernest Christy Cline</b> is an American science fiction novelist, slam poet and screenwriter. He wrote the novels <i>Ready Player One</i>, <i>Armada</i>, and <i>Ready Player Two</i>, and co-wrote the screenplay for the film adaptation of <i>Ready Player One</i>, directed by Steven Spielberg.</p>"
